<SiteLayout title="Services — Zskylo" description="Explore Zskylo's software development and brand growth services, alongside our own digital products.">
  <section class="page-hero wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> What we do / Three divisions</p>
    <h1>Three areas.<br /><span class="text-blue">One clear approach.</span></h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Zskylo works across client software, brand content and our own digital products. Explore what each division is here to do.</p>
  </section>
  <nav class="wrap service-index" aria-label="Services on this page">
    <a href="#software"><span>01</span><strong>Software Development</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↘</b></a>
    <a href="#growth"><span>02</span><strong>Brand Growth</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↘</b></a>
    <a href="#products-division"><span>03</span><strong>Our Products</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↘</b></a>
  </nav>
  <section id="software" class="service-block wrap">
    <div class="service-meta"><span>01 / SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT</span><span>For businesses and organisations</span></div>
    <div class="service-content"><div><h2>Build the digital tools<br />your work needs.</h2><p class="service-kicker">We turn business requirements into useful websites, platforms and software.</p></div><div><p>From a public-facing website to an e-commerce platform or a custom CRM, we plan and develop digital experiences around the purpose they need to serve. The focus is on making information, services and business processes easier to access and use.</p><ul class="capability-list"><li>Website design & development</li><li>E-commerce platforms</li><li>CRM systems</li><li>Custom digital tools</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/work/">See software projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section id="growth" class="service-block service-muted">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="service-meta"><span>02 / BRAND GROWTH</span><span>For brands and businesses</span></div>
      <div class="service-content"><div><h2>Give your brand<br />something to say.</h2><p class="service-kicker">Plan the message, create the content and bring it together for delivery.</p></div><div><p>Brand Growth brings creative production and marketing activity together. Depending on the brief, work can include video editing, social media marketing, digital marketing, ad scripting, shooting and complete content delivery.</p><ul class="capability-list"><li>Video editing</li><li>Social media marketing</li><li>Digital marketing</li><li>Ad scripting</li><li>Shooting & production</li><li>Complete content delivery</li></ul><div class="coming-panel"><span class="status-dot"></span><div><strong>Portfolio coming soon</strong><p>We’ll add selected work here after it has been reviewed and categorised as Ads or Video Editing.</p></div></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="products-division" class="service-block wrap">
    <div class="service-meta"><span>03 / OUR PRODUCTS</span><span>Ideas developed by Zskylo</span></div>
    <div class="service-content"><div><h2>Products shaped<br />around real needs.</h2><p class="service-kicker">We also create and develop digital products of our own.</p></div><div><p>This division is where our own product ideas take shape. Each has a distinct purpose, from helping families discover care services to making local events easier to find.</p><div class="product-division-list"><a href="/products/"><strong>AashrayaCare</strong><span>Caregiver and care-home discovery platform <b>↗</b></span></a><div><strong>Yittzy</strong><span>Town event-listing platform <em>Coming soon</em></span></div><a href="/products/"><strong>Cashify Wallet</strong><span>Fintech product website <b>↗</b></span></a></div><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore our products <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap service-end"><p class="eyebrow">Not sure where to begin?</p><h2>Tell us what you’re<br /><span class="text-blue">trying to achieve.</span></h2><a class="button" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
